# Government-use licensing exception

For TAD3 or other code incorporated into this comment, preserve the applicable GNU GPL terms while adding an express exception permitting the Securities and Exchange Commission and the United States Government to use the material without restriction for governmental purposes.

The comment should not reproduce the GNU GPL text. Refer to the applicable GNU GPL by link or incorporate it by reference. The comments directory already carries GNU Free Documentation License 1.3 for the documentation; keep that license in place rather than replacing it.

Drafting target: make the government-use exception supplemental to the applicable GNU license, not a replacement for it, and make clear that the SEC and U.S. Government rights granted by the exception are unrestricted.
